The source code is spread amongst these sub-packages:

aapl   - General Purpose Template Library.
libfsm - Finite state machine construction and code generation.
colm   - Colm Programming Language.
cgil   - Code generation intermediate language, written in colm.
ragel  - Ragel State Machine Compiler.

Only colm is configured: config.h, defs.h and version.h are generated in
src/colm. The other components take nothing from configure.
